//RS /// Card #131 / D-SERDE5: pre-evaluate every `#[Default(expr)]` argument on a
//RS /// `#[Codable]`/`#[Encode]`/`#[Decode]` struct field to a compile-time value,
//RS /// stashed on the marker (`Marker::ct`). Runs after `eval_comptime_items`, so a
//RS /// default may reference a `comptime` const. Codegen serializes this value and
//RS /// the comptime decode tier reuses it, so the two tiers bake the same default —
//RS /// a non-primitive `#[Default(expr)]` never silently degrades to
//RS /// `Default::default()` (R11/R12). A non-const argument is E2414.
//RS pub(crate) fn comptime_context_from_items(
//RS     items: &[Item],
